{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"平展同伦论"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"平展同伦论"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>todo: 重新整理资料</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>平展同伦的概念可理解为如下经典事实的推广: 考虑仿紧 (paracompact) 拓扑空间 $X$ 的好覆盖 (即任意有限个开集的交为空或可缩) $\\{U_i \\to X\\}$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Cech脉","text":"Cech 脉"}},{"Plain":", 逐项取其连通分支的集合, 所得的单纯集表现了 $X$ 的同伦型.</p>\n<p>更一般地, 对于局部可缩空间 $X$, 没有好覆盖的概念, 但可以考虑"},{"Local":{"url":"超覆盖","text":"超覆盖"}},{"Plain":"的类似构造, 对所有超覆盖给出的单纯集取极限.</p>\n<p>在任何"},{"Local":{"url":"景","text":"景"}},{"Plain":"上都可以做类似的事情. 在"},{"Local":{"url":"平展景","text":"平展景"}},{"Plain":"上做的事情叫做平展同伦论.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>But the concept is much more general. In particular, one can understand the construction of the limit over contractions of hypercovers as a presentation of naturally defined (∞,1)-functors in (∞,1)-topos theory.</p>\n<p>Notably, if the given site is a locally ∞-connected site, then the étale homotopy construction computes precisely the derived functor that presents the <strong>fundamental ∞-groupoid</strong> in a locally ∞-connected (∞,1)-topos. Many constructions in the literature can be understood as being explicit realizations of this simple general concept.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象的形","text":"∞-意象的形"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}